  "title": "Canton Strategic Holdings, Inc. Expected to Be Included in Russell 3000® and Russell 2000®",
  "summary": "Canton Strategic Holdings today announced it is expected to join the broad-market Russell 3000® Index and the small-cap Russell 2000® Index following the semi-annual reconstitution, effective after market close on June 26, 2026, according to a preliminary list of additions published by FTSE Russell.",
